{"hymn":"S59","parent":"E77","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"¡Hoy aquel Nombre exaltad","subtitle":"Alabanza al Señor—Su nombre","syl":{"n1":"¡Hoy","n2":["a","i"],"n3":["quel","t"],"n4":["Nom","i"],"n5":["bre","t"],"n6":["e","i"],"n7":["xal","m"],"n8":["tad!","t"],"n9":["Pro","i"],"n10":["cla","m"],"n11":["me‿el","t"],"n12":["cie","i"],"n13":["lo","t"],"n14":"su","n15":["po","i"],"n16":["der;","t"],"n17":"El","n18":["Nom","i"],"n19":["bre","t"],"n20":"del","n21":["triun","i"],"n22":["fan","m"],"n23":["te","t"],"n24":"Rey","n25":["De","i"],"n26":["be","t"],"n27":"la","n28":["tie","i"],"n30":["rra‿e","m"],"n31":["nal","m"],"n32":["te","m"],"n33":["cer.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["¡Hoy aquel Nombre exaltad!","Nuestro refugio y torre es él;","En aflicción podemos ver","Qué victorioso‿el Nombre es."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["¡Hoy aquel Nombre exaltad!","Hasta la tierra conquistar;","Muerte, pecado y el pesar","Cristo en Su reino anulará."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["¡Hoy aquel Nombre exaltad!","Y el Rey de reyes regirá;","Su Nombre sobre todos es,","Nombre que‿amamos complacer."]},{"label":"5.","lines":["¡Hoy aquel Nombre exaltad!","Toda rodilla se hincará;","Verá el fruto de Su cruz,","Nuestro Señor y Rey, Jesús."]}]}